# Build context for extras/render-server, whose context is the repository root
# because the image has to carry frame/ and the collage's label font.
#
# The illustrations are half a gigabyte and the renderer never opens them - it
# fetches cutouts from the station over HTTP, like the browser does. Everything
# else here is either history, other people's build output, or the lab.
.git
.github
avian/assets
extras/perf/out
extras/render-server/out
extras/render-server/config
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/node_modules
*.log
